title: Psalm 49: Dark Sayings upon the Harp
description: Psalm 49 in the King James Bible: the futility of riches when death awaits all, Solomon's Ecclesiastes and Proverbs, none can redeem his brother, but God will redeem my soul from the power of the grave, and the dark sayings and parables made plain in Christ, from the Psalms series study.
